@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Your data"; }
<section class="service-message">
    <h1>Your data in HealthTrack</h1>
    <p>Account details, health readings, and appointments are stored in the SQL Server database configured by the operator of this instance.</p>
    <p>Patients can view and manage their own records. Authorized doctors can review the patient directory and linked health records. Removing a patient from the doctor directory does not delete the patient's account or health history.</p>
    <p>Contact your instance administrator for help with account access, data correction, retention, or deletion. Use Logout to end your session on a shared device.</p>
</section>
